[38;5;189m[38;5;102m 51[m   [1m**Def [m[1;38;5;212m$Interval[m[1m (interval).**[m An interval [Start, End] is closed, with Start <= End. Zero [m    
[38;5;189m[38;5;102m   [m   length[m                                                                                        
