[38;5;189m[38;5;102m 54[m   [1m**Def [m[1;38;5;212m$Interval.Gap[m[1m (gap, within).**[m For intervals A and B with A.Start <= B.Start, gap(A, B) [m
[38;5;189m[38;5;102m   [m   = B.Start - A.End,[m                                                                            
[38;5;189m[38;5;102m 55[m   negative when they overlap. "Within d" means gap <= d; "more than d apart" means gap > d. [m    
